223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (   ABHEDYA is a portable, non-contact Raman spectroscopy based screening system designed for rapid detection of suspicious narcotic and explosive materials in railway environments. It provides a low cost, accessible alternative for first level molecular screening, using a self developed Raman sensing unit and Raspberry Pi for spectral acquisition and processing. PCA and machine learning classification compare measured Raman molecular  fingerprints with a reference spectral library. The approach Achives the maximum practical spectroscopic capability within a minimal cost architecture, while enabling future integration with certified confirmation techniques.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
